{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47297","headline":"览古十四首 十 · 吴筠","name":"览古十四首 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绦侯成大绩，赏厚位仍尊。\n一朝对狱吏，荣辱安可论。\n苏生佩六印，奕奕爲殃源。\n主父食五鼎，昭昭成祸根。\n李斯佐二辟，巨衅锺其门。\n霍孟翼三后，伊戚及後昆。\n天人忌盈满，兹理固永存。\n方知得意者，何必乘朱轮。\n灭景栖远壑，弦歌对清樽。\n二疏返海滨，蒋诩归林园。\n萧洒去物累，此谋诚足敦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47297.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47297","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}